  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deepening Democratic Governance Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201c;To strengthen democratic governance in Ghana through the provision of targeted financial and technical assistance to key Electoral Management Bodies (EMBs) and civil society. This is to strengthen the institutional capacity of EMBs to support transparent, accountable and inclusive electoral process as well as promote a more effective citizen engagement, particularly of women, youth, persons with disabilities and other marginalised groups through civic and voter education.&#x201d;</narrative>
  </description>
